+
+## R01 retirement
+
+R01 (#167, specification #175) removes cash groups, investment strategies,
+notification rules and ledger customers from the active import registry. Live
+acquisition, saved `--input` and direct publication reject before acquisition,
+input reads or storage changes. Calendars, ledger accounts (INNER and OUTER)
+and business lines remain excluded. Existing datasets and saved inputs remain
+available for authorized historical analysis. Ledger retirement follows business
+confirmation, not an assertion that its source has not changed for years.
 
